  "description": "In a world where destiny is branded on their skin, Sepia, the human empress of the beastkin empire, is threatened by a new rival: Titié, a white deer, with Demios the emperor’s name emblazoned on her chest. Amidst Titié’s malicious attempts, Sepia clings to her role as empress and the Star of Ishtar, determined to fulfill her destiny as the empire’s savior. Enter Roxan, a wolf beastkin and cousin to Demois, whose allure stirs Sepia’s feelings. In a web of love, loyalty, and deception, can Sepia reclaim her power and discover the truth of her heart?\n\n(Source: WEBTOON)",
